From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kc <barteo@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 11:55:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] Move FIR-internal queries behind KcExtras

KSP casts Analysis API symbols and types to their FIR implementation
classes for about a dozen facts the public API lacks: type mapping modes,
raw types, function type abbreviations, the container source of library
callables, Java annotation defaults, lazy resolution, library module
names and Kotlin class file reading.

Collect them in the KcExtras interface, so that an Analysis API that is
not FIR based can provide them. FirExtras is the stock implementation:
the casts KSP made inline, unchanged. Each run sets KcExtras.instance for
its thread.
